"* **Deep File Localization**: Fixed missing string translations deep within "
"the Excel enhancement modules (such as the Sheet Layout Analyzer and Quick "
"Sheet Mover) to ensure 100% localization coverage.\n"
"* **Expanded Translation Support**: Added 7 new languages to the system "
"(Turkish, Polish, Korean, Ukrainian, Czech, Urdu, and Punjabi). \n"
